<!--
  MapUnite notification icon (status bar, while a ride is shared in the background).
  Copy to android/app/src/main/res/drawable/ic_stat_mapunite.xml.
  Must be a white shape on transparent — Android tints it. If this file is
  missing, the background-location notification can't be shown and Android
  stops the app ("did not call startForeground in time").
-->
